                "text": "Donald Trump and Mike Johnson\u2019s plan to slash Medicaid is nothing short of a direct assault on the Bronx.\n\nThey can dress it up in budget buzzwords, but what they\u2019re really doing is gutting our hospitals, defunding our clinics, and putting countless lives at risk.\n\nShameful.",
